# Scenario "strdump" (new firmware only, configuration fatal_size): the QNICE
# Monitor dumps parts of the string ROM (device 0007) through the 4k window,
# in all four windows and in window 4, which shows window 0 again because the
# block RAM has 14 address bits. "strrom_tools.py dumpcheck" compares the dump
# with m2m-strings.rom.
reset
wait_uart 800 Core stopped. Please reset the machine.
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MCFFF40007
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
mark window 0
send MCFFF50000
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MD7000701F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
send MD7FE07FFF
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
mark window 1
send MCFFF50001
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MD7000701F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
send MD7FE07FFF
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
mark window 2
send MCFFF50002
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MD7000701F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
send MD7360737F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
mark window 3
send MCFFF50003
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MD7000700F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
mark window 4
send MCFFF50004
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MD7000701F
wait_uart 400 QMON>\x20
mark device and window as the monitor shows them
send MEFFF4
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send MEFFF5
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
end
